{{page-title "Validate AI Annotations"}}

<AuBodyContainer @scroll={{true}} class="au-u-padding">
  <AuHeading @skin={{1}} @level={{1}}>
    Validate AI Annotations
  </AuHeading>
  <p>
    In the VMM project, AI tooling analyses the text of action plans in the multi-year plans of local government organisations, and maps
    them to a concept list containing the action points of the <AuLinkExternal
      href="https://www.vlaanderen.be/publicaties/vlaams-klimaatadaptatieplan-vlaanderen-wapenen-tegen-de-klimaatverandering"
      @newTab={{true}}
    >
      Flemish Climate Adaptation Plan
    </AuLinkExternal>. This interface allows human users
    to review and validate these AI-generated annotations.
  </p>

    <div class="au-o-grid au-o-grid--tiny au-u-margin-top">
      {{#each @model.apps as |app|}}
        <div class="au-o-grid__item au-u-1-2">
          <AuCard class="au-u-padding" as |c|>
            <c.header>
              <AuHeading @skin={{4}} @level={{2}}>
                {{app.title}}
              </AuHeading>
            </c.header>
            <c.content>
              {{app.description}}
            </c.content>
            <c.footer>
              <AuLink @skin="button" @route={{app.route}} @query={{app.params}}>
                Start validation
              </AuLink>
            </c.footer>
          </AuCard>
        </div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  {{outlet}}
</AuBodyContainer>
